#: source/protocols/binary-cache/narinfo.md:1
msgid "`.narinfo` Format"
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/narinfo.md:3
msgid ""
"A `.narinfo` file contains the [metadata of a store object](../../store/"
"store-object.md#metadata) in the [binary cache](../../protocols/binary-cache/"
"index.md) format. It is a simple line-oriented format where each line is a "
"`Key: Value` pair. Some keys (e.g. `Sig`) may appear multiple times."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/narinfo.md:7
msgid ""
"The file is named `<hash>.narinfo`, where `<hash>` is the [hash part](../../"
"store/store-path.md#digest) of the store object's [store path](../../store/"
"store-path.md)."
msgstr ""

#: source/protocols/binary-cache/narinfo.md:9
msgid ""
"The fields correspond to those documented in the [store object info](../../"
"protocols/json/store-object-info.md) JSON format:"
msgstr ""

